# Copy to `guest.env` and fill in the ONE secret for your chosen guest image.
# This file is passed to the container via --env-file. NEVER put anything a guest
# could misuse beyond your intent.

# === SUBSCRIPTION image (Dockerfile.guest, recommended) ===
# Your Claude subscription token from `claude setup-token` (~1 year).
# Guests run on YOUR 5h/weekly limits. The in-container Claude Code lockdown
# (managed-settings: Bash off, /proc denied, files confined to /workspace)
# prevents the agent from ever reading this token.
CLAUDE_CODE_OAUTH_TOKEN=

# Public base URL for the magic links printed by `guest new`:
CWI_PUBLIC_URL=https://guest.astechlab.dev

# === ALTERNATIVE: API-key image (Dockerfile, native engine) ===
# Instead of the subscription, use a dedicated, revocable, budget-capped key.
# Comment out the token above and use these instead:
# CWI_AGENT_PROVIDER=gemini
# CWI_AGENT_GEMINI_API_KEY=
